<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIAN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTSSS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIAN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTSSS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Russian Cup semifinal played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Dynamo Moscow  1  Zenit St Petersburg  0</p>
<p>The other semifinal between Lokomotiv Moscow and Krylya Sovietov Samara will be played on Wednesday.</p>
